    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add to wishful</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749040/extras/da69a978014d7ace3267388315619e01.poster.avif?t=1750721552\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749040/extras/da69a978014d7ace3267388315619e01.webm?t=1750721552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749040/extras/da69a978014d7ace3267388315619e01.mp4?t=1750721552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>It helps a lot to promote the game on Steam \u2764\ufe0f</i></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GENRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strategy card game in the FFA format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOR WHOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our game is designed specially for those who appreciate the ability to think strategically, who look for intellectual challenges and want to play something special.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six players confront each other for leadership through efficient resource allocation and tactical use of the abilities of Heroes and Disciples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES AND PRINCIPLES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749040/extras/4017ae07bbab682df5dc3bc62d6a6ee2.avif?t=1750721552\" width=150 height=96 /></span><strong>WE CARE FOR THE COMMUNITY</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suggest ideas, discuss changes and influence the development of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking care of the players is our top priority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749040/extras/8645c0af1a6f99f0da11c41e236c6e7a.avif?t=1750721552\" width=150 height=96 /></span><strong>NEXT GENERATION GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep strategies, multiple opportunities and the unique character of each game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can find all this in a next generation game which turns the concept of the card entertainment upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749040/extras/4e64384e182098431bff37b92633df1d.avif?t=1750721552\" width=150 height=96 /></span><strong>AFFORDABLE AND FREE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself into a fascinating world absolutely for free. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no need to build decks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play freely and enjoy every moment of the game without a care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749040/extras/97fd9a6021c8e073a4a295f72a271e89.avif?t=1750721552\" width=150 height=96 /></span><strong>FREEDOM OF COLLECTING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to change the visual style of different aspects of the game for yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will be possible to trade collectibles with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749040/extras/591886f26af8f0729eb02356d289def2.avif?t=1750721552\" width=150 height=96 /></span><strong>DEVELOPMENT OF CYBERSPORTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-fledged in-game tournaments where virtual maps become the canvas for real sporting feats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a part of the cybersports evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749040/extras/c2cd76104bb332e691bbba4c3fc772a6.avif?t=1750721552\" width=150 height=96 /></span><strong>SKILL OVER RANDOM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, pure random yields in the face of true masters of card battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exalt your skill over random.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FUTURE CONTENT:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive and Tournament modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duo mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game editor and Community modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saving and reviewing game recordings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game assistant and detailed statistics for players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P2P market</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization of the game interface and cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>System of Guilds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TopDeck Studio</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749040/extras/cda9a1a939f450a6cfa3bcdc6bd17cab.avif?t=1750721552\" width=100 height=100 /></span> <i>By Games, for Gamers.</i></p>",
